WEBVTT

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:31.490
so that other parents, too, would encourage
their kids to do the same?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:36.980
RK: I think the confidence that my parents
showed me 20 years back,

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:41.419
I see that in most parents today.

00:08:41.419 --> 00:08:43.510
I don’t think there 
is much differentiation

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.160
between girls and boys anymore.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:49.920
But yes, we have to go deep 
into the country’s villages,

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.100
towns, and bring 
this thought there as well.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:56.060
We have to bring this ideology there,
that whether girls belong to a big city

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.100
or small towns or villages,

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.290
with parental support, 
they can succeed.